##### after the run: screenshots
The log above names three screenshots that are not kept: dashboard-embedded.png,
launch-native-view.png and workflows-end.png. A screenshot is a capture of a
screen region, and at those three moments a window of the operator's own
desktop was in front of the app, so they showed that window instead. They were
deleted unpublished. With the world still up and nothing else changed, the app
was brought forward and two were taken in their place:
screenshot: dashboard-view.png (the embedded Dashboard at the end of the run; the window had been moved partly off the left edge of the screen, so the sidebar is cut)
screenshot: session-native-view.png (beta's native view at the end of the run, same framing)
The other six screenshots were taken during the run and show the app only.
shot() in driver/lib.sh now brings the app forward before every capture.
